## 📂 Installation

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/ANJx24/your-repository-name.git
```

Navigate to the project:

```bash
cd your-repository-name
```

Install dependencies (if applicable):

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Run the application:

```bash
python app.py
```

